, "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2086185491737522176/vid/avc1/480x270/wI5z-O0jOvOpUMPJ.mp4"}, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2082935138908807168/5gcv3sQ4_normal.jpg", "displayName": "James David Dickson", "username": "downi75"}, "content": "\u201cYou\u2019re gonna wanna not get these things (Qurans) in the shot. Trying to keep the shot secular.\u201d\n\u2014Abdul El-Sayed in 2018", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1958}, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 45, "created": 1786230403000, "id": "2086227637043654999", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2018743563488571392/jZ0MJk6q_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Jack Posobiec", "username": "JackPosobiec"}, "content": "Oh", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 4569}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCE20PvX", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 17, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8771483, "raw_content": "That's it. Nothing about it is extreme. Not to the left or the right. \n\n&nbsp;\n\nPeople shouldn't be in the country illegally. \n\n&nbsp;\n\nOnly citizens should vote. \n\n&nbsp;\n\nFraud is bad. \n\n&nbsp;\n\nCriminals should be behind bars, and would-be criminals should fear imprisonment. \n\n&nbsp;\n\nWe shouldn't have to fund/ protect the rest of the world.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nMen are men and women are women. Both have their own strengths and weaknesses.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nNothing about this is extreme. MSM does a good job of whipping people into a frenzy over what is really just common sense.  ", "author": "Siteless_Vagrant", "created": 1786290187248, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "GA_Logic", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "MAGA means common sense. ", "last_comment_created": 1786290843031, "content": "<p>That's it. Nothing about it is extreme. Not to the left or the right.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>People shouldn't be in the country illegally.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Only citizens should vote.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Fraud is bad.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Criminals should be behind bars, and would-be criminals should fear imprisonment.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>We shouldn't have to fund/ protect the rest of the world.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Men are men and women are women. Both have their own strengths and weaknesses.</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Nothing about this is extreme. MSM does a good job of whipping people into a frenzy over what is really just common sense.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 17, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCE0sZN9", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 321, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8770667, "raw_content": "", "author": "bigdickhangsright", "created": 1786232642466, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Double_D", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCE0sZN9.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/GldKE4RuX0qG.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/